 "text": "Proactive AI is coming. AI that does things before you ask offers to do things. Awesome, really cool features and really helpful but a bit dangerous because once they're connected Muse into your WhatsApp, Amazon for your groceries, Google for your emails, it can get a bit dangerous. So my first step is the no spending, no sending rule. It doesn't spend my money, doesn't send anything out for me unless I say so. And the fun part is I didn't even write this myself. I just put one prompt into my AI tool and it started asking me questions back, then it locks itself down or tells you how to lock it down. Prompt's in the comments, make sure you do this, no spending, no sending, one easy step so you can save yourself and enjoy these new technologies without any of those weird moments or fails.",
